+// nothing is copied, boxed, or re-derived from the name the source wrote.
+//
+// One slot is not the whole answer. A segment the source spelled `unknown` is stored as the erased
+// carrier BESIDE the named alternatives, so a value the runtime boxed there is the same value this test
+// is about. That arm is answered by the same checked projection an erased operand uses, and the test is
+// the union of the two -- never widened, and never true for an arm the source did not name.
